# side track O, O.3: frame advance (ci-arty-gb). Paused at once, before
# the first frame start; then three steps, each followed by about three
# frames' time: each runs the core to its next frame start only, so PS_IN
# bit 7 flips three times (more if a step ran on)
ctrl 2
wait 50000
ctrl 6
wait 50000
ctrl 6
wait 50000
ctrl 6
wait 60000
